WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.640
So, we're in volume 16 and starting on May the 19th, 1924 and this is about acts in the

2
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:16.300
divine will. So, all the acts of one who lives in the divine will, from the littlest to the

3
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:23.480
greatest, acquire the value of eternal and divine acts. This is absolutely marvelous

4
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:31.960
stuff. Louisa says, "My poor mind wandered in the immensity of the supreme volition. I

5
00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:39.120
felt as if I was inside a sea, and my whole being was drinking in large gulps the solitary

6
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:47.680
water of the eternal will." Now, normally they word "water" certainly in the Bible

7
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:54.160
is used to represent the waters of salvation or the waters of grace. And here Louisa is

8
00:00:54.160 --> 00:01:00.600
using the image of the divine will which is the fullness of life, the fullness of grace,

9
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:07.640
the fullness of salvation. So, think in terms of fullness. So, it's the fullness of life

10
00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:19.380
and salvation. It entered into me through all parts, through my ears, through my mouth,

11
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:25.320
through my eyes, through my nostrils, through all the pores of my body. Now, there's a person

12
00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:36.440
completely open to the divine will, totally disposed. Now, while I was in this state,

13
00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:44.400
my sweet Jesus moved in my interior and told me, "My daughter, my will is eternal, and

14
00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:51.400
only one who lives in it." Now, that means not twice or three times a day, actually living

15
00:01:51.400 --> 00:02:00.200
in the divine will, embraces eternity. And all of her acts from the littlest to the greatest

16
00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:08.360
being animated by an eternal will all acquire the value, the merit, and the form of divine

17
00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:14.640
and eternal acts. So, here's the perfect answer as to what an act in the divine will

18
00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:22.480
is. The divine will empties those acts of all that is human. Now, that's an extremely

19
00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:32.440
important point. If it's to be completely divine, it cannot have any human content. If

20
00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:39.960
it is totally human, it may not have any divine content. Do you know what I mean? The divine

21
00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:46.720
and the human will won't actually mix. And filling them with its divine will, it makes

22
00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:54.800
them its own and places its seal on them, constituting them as many eternal and divine

23
00:02:54.800 --> 00:03:02.320
acts. Now, I think it's a wonderful thing that the divine will places its seal on our

24
00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:09.880
acts done in the divine will. That's the divine stamp. The nothing can gain say that. This

25
00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:16.120
is accepted as a divine thing. On hearing this, Louisa was surprised and she said, "How

26
00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:23.400
is it possible that by just living in your will, the creature may receive this great

27
00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:30.320
good that her acts become eternal and divine?" Jesus said, "Why are you surprised?" It's

28
00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:37.280
the most simple thing. The whole reason is that my will is eternal and divine. And so

29
00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:42.520
you're doing your acts in the divine will. And everything that comes from the divine

30
00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:50.640
will, being a birth from an eternal and divine will, cannot be excluded from being eternal

31
00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:58.520
and divine as long as the soul puts her human will aside in place of mine. Put a VIP on

32
00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:09.800
that statement. Our motto has to be, "Not my will, but thine be done." So if we don't

33
00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:16.800
consciously put aside the human will, we are not consciously opening the door for the divine.

34
00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:25.840
And we must do that. If the soul does so, our acts are counted among ours. Look at the

35
00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:31.880
humility of God. It's absolutely incredible to me. Both the great act and the littlest

36
00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:40.760
of them. Now the littlest thing may even be just a minute interior gesture towards the

37
00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:48.200
Lord. "And besides," he said, "the same thing happened in creation. How many things

38
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:54.120
were not created, great and small, down to the little seed and the little insect? But

39
00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:59.720
as small as they may be, one cannot say that my great works were created by this supreme

40
00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:04.120
will. And therefore they are divine works because the smaller ones were not created

41
00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:12.800
by a divine hand." Of course, if you've done enough zoology and you've examined the

42
00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:20.440
intricacy of even the tiniest little living creature, you see just how incredible is the

43
00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:25.880
stamp of the divine eyes. Even little creepy crawlers you don't like, they have the most

44
00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:35.120
incredible structure. It's just amazing. And even though one can see that only everything

45
00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:41.520
that was created in the atmosphere, the heavens, the sun and the stars, is always fixed and

