00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:10.320
the birds, etc. Everything is subject to dying and being born again. Notice that. We understand

50
00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:19.960
the dying. This is dying and being born again. Let me give you the tiniest reflection on that.

51
00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:28.160
Our entire planet is called a living planet. Not just because there are living creatures

52
00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:38.440
living on it. I saw this illustrated perfectly on a YouTube thing. It was absolutely fantastic.

53
00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:45.000
And it showed that the planet is actually breathing. And this is where the weather and

54
